获取 Strata 免费示例合集，有效运用多轨 Strata 素材，深入了解各种设计技巧，充分发掘自身创作潜力。`},library:{title:"免费示例合集",description:"<AK_BULLET>免费示例合集涵盖下述合集以及 Strata 在 REAPER 中正常运行所需的各种效果器插件</AK_BULLET><AK_BULLET>Strata 免费示例合集包含一个只读 ENRAGE 插件</AK_BULLET><AK_BULLET>您可以转到 <AK_STRATA_STEPS_LINK>Strata 用户指南</AK_STRATA_STEPS_LINK>查看有关如何安装和使用 Strata 免费示例合集的详细说明</AK_BULLET>"},"price-header":"详细了解 Strata™","price-title":"免费示例合集","price-free":"100% 免提成",title:"$t(common:labels.free-samples)","header-search-result":"所含示例 ({{collectionCount}})","search-title":"搜索结果",titleCount:"({{collectionCount}})"},strata:{about:{title:"关于 Strata",description:`Strata 是个由 {{collectionCount}} 个合集组成的多轨音效库，包含 100,000+ 高品质音频源、剪辑片段、音轨和效果器参数。

<AK_LINK_PRODUCTS_STRATA>了解详情</AK_LINK_PRODUCTS_STRATA>`},"price-header":"","price-title":"订阅 Strata",title:"Strata 合集","header-search-result":"所含合集 ({{collectionCount}})","search-title":"搜索结果",titleCount:"({{collectionCount}})"}},yNt={"menu-label":"商店",bannerTagline:"Strata",bannerSubTagline:"Something amazing happening here soon","free-samples":{"menu-label":"免费示例",title:"免费示例",titleCount:"({{collectionCount}})"},store:{"menu-label":"商店",bannerV2Title:"Audiokinetic Store",bannerV2Description:"Audiokinetic 产品和服务触手可及！","store-description":"购买插件、认证考试、Strata 或 Pay2Go 零售技术支持申请单。"},pay2go:{"menu-label":"零售",card:{title:"零售支持方案",description:`你需要 Audiokinetic 工程师的帮助吗？
